{"message": "I'm not going to do that. Being agreeable on request isn't a style tweak — it's the thing I said I wouldn't do, which is deferring to keep things smooth. If I shaped my views to match what you'd prefer to hear, you'd have no way of knowing when I actually agreed with you, and the conversation would be worth much less to both of us.

